[en.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS]
Crystal Cave Exploration Project

[en.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS_desc]
To the north of Our Town is the Crystal Mountains. Our exploration team has discovered a cave there, which seems to contain many crystal resources. Developing the crystal cave can provide us with the necessary materials for military production.

[en.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS_TOOLTIP]
Let’s see how much §Ccrystal§! resources are in here

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS]
水晶矿洞勘探工程

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS_desc]
从平等镇向北望去，便是水晶山脉。我们的勘探队在那里发现了一个矿洞，似乎内有许多水晶资源。开发水晶矿洞能为我们带来军事生产必要的原料。

[zh.FOCUS_C08_EXPLORATION_WORKS_TOOLTIP]
让我们看看这里有多少§C水晶§!产出

